  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "AL3-RH-000" ;
  triage:title "Replacement-owned Tokio/Axum server activation not yet proven" ;
  triage:description "docs/plans/phase-al/AL3-durable-write-received-hook-remediation-task-list.md lines 26-34 (AL3-RH-000): atm-http-runtime must bind and serve the canonical typed Axum write route on the Tokio runtime supplied by the replacement executable, never a private runtime or Handle::block_on. Its consuming lifecycle must own listener, cancellation, task join, and bounded shutdown with no dependency on atm-daemon, concrete SQLite, tmux, graft, or daemon bootstrap. Tests must prove binding, a real HTTP request, orderly shutdown, and no leaked server task. Unchecked closure task as of the 2026-08-06 audit." ;
